        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email only please;\n\nDaly Auctioneers are pleased to present this two bed to rent in Killinaugh, Carbury, Co. Kildare.\nOwn transport is essential. \n\nLocated a few minutes` drive from the delightful village of Johnstownbridge and the bustling village of Enfield village, residents will enjoy the convenience of local amenities, shops like Tesco, SuperValu, Lidl, excellent schools, and recreational facilities like the Johnstown House Hotel and Spa, Moyvalley Golf Resort and Hotel, Hamlet Court Hotel, and Furey`s Bar and Resturaunt all within 5 minutes. Enfield GAA and Enfield Celtic FC. The area has a well-served bus route. The nearby M4 motorway ensures quick connections by road to Kilcock, Maynooth, Celbridge, Leixlip, Lucan, Dublin city centre and the west. \n\nThese particulars are issued by Daly Auctioneers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. All descriptions, dimensions etc., included in these particulars, and any statements made by us or our representatives, are made in good faith but are not intended to form the basis for any contract. Any intending tenant should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact, but should satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each before committing themselves to contract. Floorplans, maps etc. are for identification purposes only, and although believed to be correct, accuracy is not in any way guaranteed.\nPSRA No. 004925"
